  "description": "REST request body. input.payload is the ordered list of [key, value] string pairs (the wire key order is kept, never sorted). The body is jData= followed by compact JSON (separators \",\" and \":\", no spaces), non-ASCII characters written as UTF-8 (no \\u escapes), no HTML escaping of < > & or ', then only % & + percent-encoded, in that order (% first). Everything else, including = space / ? #, is sent as is. JSON string escapes: \" and \\ as \\\" and \\\\; the control characters U+0008, U+0009, U+000A, U+000C, U+000D as \\b \\t \\n \\f \\r; every other character below U+0020 as \\u00XX with lower-case hex; DEL (U+007F), U+2028 and U+2029 are sent raw as UTF-8. expected.utf8_hex is the exact body bytes.",
